  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Henohu akedisha mafwaha awanyanta jawaYuda, nimafwaha awatulamba twindi, nimafwaha awatupristu, nimafwaha atuprofwetu, nimafwaha wadiŋi nakushakama muYerusalema, akayiidisha imajamu awu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akayala kumesu etagwa, nakakweji, niyileŋaleŋa nwiwulu yejima, yanakeŋuwu, yanapeshuwu yanalonduwu, yanakeŋa ŋuwu yanadifukwiluwu. Hiyakayikuŋula, hela kuyiji ikaku, akekala shi wahewulu deseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akuchisaka ichi chatama anashaluku, anashalashali mwejima munayihaŋahaŋa dehi akatonda kufwa, hiyakatonda wumuku. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova wamazaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakayihosha nawa neyi, Yehova nahoshi nindi, Antu adimbuki, abuli iyamuka cheŋi? Muntu asenuki munjila, abuli kufunta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndochu iu awa antu amuYerusalema anaselumuki hanyima aselumukiladi wopu kupu? Anakakeli kwawu mwakudimbana, kwonti kwawu kufunta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukushaku dinukushaku matu hinukutiyilila, komana hiyadi nakuhosha chachiwahuku; kwosi muntu wabalumukili mumuchima aleka kutama kwindi, ela idi, Neli ŋahuku? Wejima wawu adi nakutalisha mwayaloŋawu, neyi valu wudi nakulotokela kunjita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋa, kakumbikumbi wahaluzwizu luka yilaaka yindiyamufu ukwilawu; nikatela, nikambimbi, nimunkoloŋa la muchima kuyilaaka yawu yenzaŋawu; hakwila antu ami hiyeluka himbi lwaYehovaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndochu mudi nakuhosha ŋahi? Nenu, Tudi namaana; nenu, himbi jaYehova tudi naju. Kutala nsonekesu yakutwamba yawansoneki akoŋi mwakutwamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwamaana anatiyi nsonyi, analokoli mukanwa, wachiki. Talenu, wena analeki dehi izu daYehova, indi dinu maana iwu nawu adi ŋahi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi aŋodi jawu nakayihana kudi antu acheŋi, nahawu nakayihana kudi antu akayiheti. Muloŋa kufumisha kudi mwivu wakehelamu nakushika kudi mwinawu wasweja kulema, wejima wawu twala dehi kwamulwisu hohu; kufumisha kudi kaprofwetu nakushika ikapristu, wejima wawu akoŋaŋa mwakutwamba hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanadikatiyi mwana kawakwetu wamumbanda anakuswishuhu chanti, navini, pamwena, kwamwena; kutoŋa hikwamwenaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakoŋeluwi yishishima atiyili nsonyi, tahindi? Nehi; hiyatiyili nsonyi nihantuku, hela izi oŋama he-te-te kutwesha nehi. Dichi akadimbuka mukachi kawakwalimbuka. Hampinji yakayi hempulavu makadimbuka. Dimu mwanahiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Nakayi noŋeshahu shati chikupu. Timuvinyu hikwakekala nyikabuku, kuchikuyu hikwakekala nkuyuku, nafu akalepuka. Niyuma yinayinki yakayifuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunashakaminidizo chochichi? Pompenu twiŋili munyi kalayayi paka, ikamwenenuku zo; muloŋa Yehova Nzambi yetu natukaŋeshi dehi mwakuhosha, natunwishi dehi meji awulembi, nanochu chituna muvulumuni hova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twatalilili kumwena, aka, hikwenjili kuwahaku, twatalilili linji yakukola, komana kudi kuhayama hohu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "KuDani kunatiyakani pwambula kudi nakupwambula tuwalu twindi; chakudi tambi kawu indiyu, ituŋa dejima hidikuzaala nalushindu. Enza dehi, adya dehi ituŋa ima niyuma yejima yidumu, nimukala, niantu ejima ashakamamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa tiyenu, nakatemesha mukachi kenu tupela, tubandanjila twabu-a kufwomonewa, akayisuma. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nidikundeja hutu huna yihuŋu iyi! Muchima wami wafwa dehi puchi yivumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu izu damwana kawantu ami wamumbanda wukudiu kwituŋa didi kwakulehi nankashi, nindi, Yehova hadi muZiyonaku, indi? Mwanta windi mwosi, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ananvu lokelidi kulonda niyizuli nawakishi awu akusoŋa, nayuma yawu yakwacheŋi yakuhemesha? Chila aka chakwaŋula chahita dehi, mwaka wanvula wamana dehi, ninetukutwa mwina nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nidi nakukata nanochu chanakatishuwu mwanakawakwetu wamumbanda, neyila dehi bwi, nakumini dakuhayama hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MuGileyadi mwosi yitumbuku, tahindi? Himwekala chimbukuku, tahindi? Indi mwana kawakwetu wamumbanda nabu lilidi kukola?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
